S in the CENTRE sings her own female reply on the actual female entrance, turning her face slightly toward the audience and opening one EMPTY palm toward Draco. Draco keeps CLOSED lips and listens, head inclining and hand settling; Ralse stays silent, gaze moving between them. Continue natural breath, cloth/arm recovery and supported small movement to the last frame, no frozen tail or pose reset. Fixed neutral-white face light, natural beige skin, physical woven cloth/satin/metal; blue belongs to set and Draco, red to Ralse/curtain. No magenta skin, flicker, extra head/limb, body blend or stone penetration. Preserve original English recording exactly, no invented speech, new voice, retime, duet or vocal from Ralse.",
